From e04af6a0d81644bbfd45b9d709b5e19190a3297c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gus bourg <gus@bourg.net>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 21:57:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 106/145] media: meson: add G12B VC-1 Advanced Profile hardware
 decode

Use the four-buffer G12 firmware protocol, validate coded geometry, and drain retained references at EOS. Normalize raw frame packets and ASF private-header bundles in the driver so the tested MKV works with unpatched FFmpeg. Keep skipped-P expansion as a bounded microcode erratum workaround.

Bench: 60/60 bit-exact 1440x576 and 144/144 bit-exact 1920x1080 with stock libavcodec; H.264, HEVC, MPEG-1, MPEG-2, and MPEG-4 each decode 24 frames with hardware interrupts. Host preprocessing checks pass with ASan/UBSan. SM1 eight-buffer experiment stalled and is excluded. No firmware blobs included.
